      "description": "\u201cRemoteDocumentController does no conflict check by default, so concurrent editors are last-write-wins until onConflict is set to reject, re\u2026\u201d contradicts \u201cOperational reshuffle preserves immutable actions where CRDTs and OT cannot\u201d. Opened automatically from a CONTRADICTS link \u2014 resolve if one side is right, dissolve if both hold in different contexts.",
